: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/contextMenu(menuItems:preview:)":{"title":"contextMenu(menuItems:preview:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/contextmenu(menuitems:preview:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/contextMenu(menuItems:preview:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"contextMenu"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"M"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"P"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"menuItems"},{"kind":"text","text":": () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"M"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"preview"},{"kind":"text","text":": () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"P"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swa